reverse":false,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":9,"is_protected":true,"source_note":"Max 2. SOLO path: hide options A and B. Hide C if I2 = Female; hide D if I2 = Male."},{"qid":"C1","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel happy in my relationship overall.","text_hi":"कुल मिलाकर मैं अपने रिश्ते में खुश हूँ।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":10,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"C2","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"We can talk about difficult things without it turning into a fight.","text_hi":"हम मुश्किल बातों पर बिना झगड़े के बात कर पाते हैं।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":11,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"C3","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel my partner understands what I am going through.","text_hi":"मुझे लगता है मेरा साथी समझता है कि मैं किस दौर से गुज़र रहा/रही हूँ।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":12,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"C4","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"Small issues turn into big arguments.","text_hi":"छोटी बातें बड़े झगड़ों में बदल जाती हैं।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":13,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"C5","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel emotionally distant from my partner.","text_hi":"मैं अपने साथी से भावनात्मक रूप से दूर महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":14,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"C6","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I trust my partner.","text_hi":"मुझे अपने साथी पर भरोसा है।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":15,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"C7","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I am satisfied with the physical closeness in my relationship.","text_hi":"मैं अपने रिश्ते की शारीरिक नज़दीकी से संतुष्ट हूँ।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":16,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"C8","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I avoid intimacy or find reasons to delay it.","text_hi":"मैं नज़दीकी से बचता/बचती हूँ या उसे टालने के बहाने ढूँढता/ढूँढती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":17,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"C9","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel confident about myself as a partner.","text_hi":"एक साथी के रूप में मुझे खुद पर भरोसा है।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":18,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"C10","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"Stress from work, family or money affects my relationship.","text_hi":"काम, परिवार या पैसों का तनाव मेरे रिश्ते पर असर डालता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":19,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"C11","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I have thought about separation or ending the relationship.","text_hi":"मैंने अलग होने या रिश्ता खत्म करने के बारे में सोचा है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":20,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Score 3 here also feeds Impact"},{"qid":"C12","module_code":"CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel hopeful that things can improve.","text_hi":"मुझे उम्मीद है कि चीज़ें बेहतर हो सकती हैं।","reverse":true,"scored":"no","path":"partner","sort":21,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Not in severity; used for report tone (PARTNER path). SOLO uses CS10."},{"qid":"CS1","module_code":"SOLO_CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel comfortable with who I am when it comes to love and closeness.","text_hi":"प्यार और नज़दीकी के मामले में मैं जैसा/जैसी हूँ, उससे मैं सहज हूँ।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"solo","sort":22,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"CS2","module_code":"SOLO_CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel lonely when it comes to love and closeness.","text_hi":"प्यार और नज़दीकी के मामले में मैं अकेलापन महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"solo","sort":23,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"CS3","module_code":"SOLO_CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I worry that I will not be good enough for a partner.","text_hi":"मुझे चिंता रहती है कि मैं किसी साथी के लिए काफी अच्छा/अच्छी नहीं हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"solo","sort":24,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"CS4","module_code":"SOLO_CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel confident about intimacy when the time comes.","text_hi":"समय आने पर नज़दीकी को लेकर मुझे खुद पर भरोसा है।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"solo","sort":25,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"CS5","module_code":"SOLO_CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I avoid dating or getting close to someone.","text_hi":"मैं किसी से मिलने-जुलने या करीब आने से बचता/बचती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"solo","sort":26,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"CS6","module_code":"SOLO_CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"Pressure from family about marriage or relationships affects me.","text_hi":"शादी या रिश्ते को लेकर परिवार का दबाव मुझ पर असर डालता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"solo","sort":27,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"CS7","module_code":"SOLO_CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"A past relationship still affects how I feel today.","text_hi":"कोई पुराना रिश्ता आज भी मेरी भावनाओं पर असर डालता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"solo","sort":28,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"CS8","module_code":"SOLO_CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I find it hard to trust people in close relationships.","text_hi":"करीबी रिश्तों में लोगों पर भरोसा करना मुझे मुश्किल लगता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"solo","sort":29,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"CS9","module_code":"SOLO_CORE","type":"likert","text_en":"I can talk openly about my needs with people close to me.","text_hi":"मैं अपने करीबी लोगों से अपनी ज़रूर