"path":"partner","sort":37,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"A7","module_code":"A","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel respected by my partner.","text_hi":"मेरा साथी मुझे सम्मान देता है, ऐसा मुझे लगता है।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":38,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"A8","module_code":"A","type":"likert","text_en":"We make time for each other without phones or family around.","text_hi":"हम एक-दूसरे के लिए फोन और परिवार से अलग समय निकालते हैं।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":39,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"B1","module_code":"B","type":"likert","text_en":"I rarely feel the desire for intimacy.","text_hi":"मुझे नज़दीकी की इच्छा बहुत कम होती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":40,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"B2","module_code":"B","type":"likert","text_en":"My partner and I want intimacy at very different frequencies.","text_hi":"मैं और मेरा साथी नज़दीकी बहुत अलग-अलग बार चाहते हैं।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":41,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"B3","module_code":"B","type":"likert","text_en":"Intimacy feels like a duty rather than something I enjoy.","text_hi":"नज़दीकी एक ज़िम्मेदारी जैसी लगती है, खुशी जैसी नहीं।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":42,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"B4","module_code":"B","type":"yn","text_en":"We have not been intimate in the last 3 months.","text_hi":"पिछले 3 महीनों में हमारे बीच नज़दीकी नहीं हुई है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":43,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"B5","module_code":"B","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel loved even when we are not physically close.","text_hi":"शारीरिक नज़दीकी न होने पर भी मुझे प्यार महसूस होता है।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":44,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"B6","module_code":"B","type":"likert","text_en":"With time (or after children), closeness between us has reduced a lot.","text_hi":"समय के साथ (या बच्चों के बाद) हमारे बीच नज़दीकी बहुत कम हो गई है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":45,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"B7","module_code":"B","type":"likert","text_en":"I find it hard to tell my partner what I want.","text_hi":"मुझे अपने साथी को यह बताना मुश्किल लगता है कि मैं क्या चाहता/चाहती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":46,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"B8","module_code":"B","type":"likert","text_en":"Tiredness, body image or health worries reduce my interest.","text_hi":"थकान, अपने शरीर को लेकर सोच या सेहत की चिंता मेरी रुचि कम कर देती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":47,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"M1","module_code":"C","type":"likert","text_en":"I worry about my performance before or during intimacy.","text_hi":"नज़दीकी से पहले या उस दौरान मुझे अपने प्रदर्शन की चिंता रहती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":48,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"M2","module_code":"C","type":"likert","text_en":"I finish sooner than I or my partner would like.","text_hi":"मैं जितना चाहता हूँ या मेरा साथी चाहता है, उससे जल्दी खत्म हो जाता हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":49,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"M3","module_code":"C","type":"likert","text_en":"I have difficulty getting or keeping firmness during intimacy.","text_hi":"नज़दीकी के दौरान मुझे कड़ापन पाने या बनाए रखने में दिक्कत होती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":50,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"M4","module_code":"C","type":"likert","text_en":"I wake up with morning firmness at least a few times a week.","text_hi":"हफ्ते में कम से कम कुछ बार सुबह कड़ापन के साथ मेरी नींद खुलती है।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":51,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"M4=Never + M3>=2 = medical signal"},{"qid":"M5","module_code":"C","type":"likert","text_en":"The problem happens mostly with my partner, much less when I am alone.","text_hi":"यह दिक्कत ज़्यादातर साथी के साथ होती है, अकेले में बहुत कम।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":52,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"High = psychological pattern (good news for therapy)"},{"qid":"M6","module_code":"C","type":"likert","text_en":"I avoid intimacy because I am afraid of failing.","text_hi":"असफल होने के डर से मैं नज़दीकी से बचता हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":53,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"M7","module_code":"C","type":"likert","text_en":"My partner's reaction to this has hurt my confidence.","text_hi":"इस पर मेरे साथी की प्रतिक्रिया ने मेरा आत्मविश्वास तोड़ा है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":54,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"M8","module_code":"C","type":"likert","text_en":"I take a very long time or cannot finish during intimacy.","text_hi":"नज़दीकी के दौरान मुझे बहुत समय लगता है या मैं खत्म नहीं कर पाता।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":55,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"M9","module_code":"C","type":"likert","text_en":"I compare myself to what I see online or in films.","text_hi":"मैं खुद की तुलना ऑनलाइन या फिल्मों में देखी चीज़ों से करता हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":56,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"M10","module_code":"C","type":"single","text_en":"This problem started","text_hi":"यह दिक्कत शुरू हुई","reverse":false,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":57,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Sudden = medical flag. Not scored."},{"qid":"F1","module_code":"D","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel pain or burning during intimacy.","text_hi":"नज़दीकी के दौरान मुझे दर्द या जलन होती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":58,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"F2","module_code":"D","type":"likert","text_en":"My body tightens or closes up when intimacy is attempted.","text_hi":"नज़दीकी की कोशिश पर मेरा शरीर कस जाता है या बंद हो जाता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":59,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"F3","module_code":"D","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel fear or panic at the thought of intimacy.","text_hi":"नज़दीकी के ख्याल से ही मुझे डर या घबराहट होती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":60,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"F4","module_code":"D","type":"yn","text_en":"We have not been able to complete intercourse.","text_hi":"हम संभोग पूरा नहीं कर पाए हैं।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":61,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"F5","module_code":"D","type":"likert","text_en":"Pressure from family about children makes this worse.","text_hi":"बच्चों को लेकर परिवार का दबाव इसे और बुरा बनाता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":62,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"F6","module_code":"D","type":"likert","text_en":"My partner is patient and understanding about this.","text_hi":"मेरा साथी इस बारे में धैर्य और समझदारी रखता है।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":63,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"F7","module_code":"D","type":"likert","text_en":"I avoid gynaecological check-ups or using tampons because of discomfort.","text_hi":"असहजता के कारण मैं स्त्री-रोग जाँच या टैम्पोन के इस्तेमाल से बचती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":64,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"F8","module_code":"D","type":"yn","text_en":"I have had a medical check-up for this.","text_hi":"मैंने इसके लिए डॉक्टर से जाँच करवाई है।","reverse":true,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":65,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"No + module D >= Mild = medical flag. Not scored."},{"qid":"P1","module_code":"E","type":"likert","text_en":"I spend more time on porn or self-pleasure than I intend to.","text_hi":"मैं पोर्न या स्व-आनंद पर जितना चाहता/चाहती हूँ उससे ज़्यादा समय बिताता/बिताती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":66,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"P2","module_code":"E","type":"likert","text_en":"I have tried to reduce it and could not.","text_hi":"मैंने इसे कम करने की कोशिश की पर कर नहीं पाया/पाई।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":67,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"P3","module_code":"E","type":"likert","text_en":"It affects my interest or performance with my real partner.","text_hi":"यह मेरे असली साथी के साथ मेरी रुचि या प्रदर्शन पर असर डालता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":68,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"P4","module_code":"E","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel guilt or shame afterwards.","text_hi":"बाद में मुझे अपराधबोध या शर्म महसूस होती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":69,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"P5","module_code":"E","type":"likert","text_en":"I use it to cope with stress, boredom or loneliness.","text_hi":"मैं इसका इस्तेमाल तनाव, ऊब या अकेलेपन से निपटने के लिए करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":70,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"P6","module_code":"E","type":"likert","text_en":"It has affected my work, sleep or studies.","text_hi":"इसने मेरे काम, नींद या पढ़ाई पर असर डाला है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":71,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"P7","module_code":"E","type":"likert","text_en":"My partner knows, and it has caused conflict between us.","text_hi":"मेरे साथी को पता है, और इससे हमारे बीच झगड़ा हुआ है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":72,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"P8","module_code":"E","type":"likert","text_en":"I need more intense content than before to feel the same.","text_hi":"पहले जैसा महसूस करने के लिए अब मुझे ज़्यादा तीव्र सामग्री चाहिए।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":73,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"S1","module_code":"F","type":"likert","text_en":"Over the last 2 weeks, I have felt down, low or hopeless.","text_hi":"पिछले 2 हफ्तों में मैंने उदास, नीचा या निराश महसूस किया है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":74,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"S2","module_code":"F","type":"likert","text_en":"I have had little interest or pleasure in things I usually enjoy.","text_hi":"जिन चीज़ों में मुझे आमतौर पर मज़ा आता है, उनमें रुचि कम हो गई है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":75,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"S3","module_code":"F","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel nervous, anxious or on edge.","text_hi":"मैं घबराया/घबराई हुई या बेचैन महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":76,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"S4","module_code":"F","type":"likert","text_en":"I cannot stop worrying.","text_hi":"मैं चिंता करना रोक नहीं पाता/पाती।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":77,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"S5","module_code":"F","type":"likert","text_en":"My sleep is disturbed.","text_hi":"मेरी नींद खराब रहती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":78,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"S6","module_code":"F","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel I am not good enough as a partner or as a person.","text_hi":"मुझे लगता है कि मैं एक साथी या इंसान के रूप में काफी अच्छा/अच्छी नहीं हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":79,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"S7","module_code":"F","type":"likert","text_en":"I get irritated with my partner quickly.","text_hi":"मैं अपने साथी पर जल्दी चिड़ जाता/जाती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":80,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"S8","module_code":"F","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel lonely even when I am with my partner.","text_hi":"साथी के साथ होते हुए भी मैं अकेला/अकेली महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":81,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"T1","module_code":"G","type":"yn","text_en":"Something from the past (a betrayal, broken trust or a hurtful experience) still affects me today. You do not need to describe it.","text_hi":"अतीत की कोई बात (धोखा, टूटा भरोसा या कोई दुखद अनुभव) आज भी मुझ पर असर करती है। आपको उसका विवरण देने की ज़रूरत नहीं है।","reverse":false,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":82,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"No details are asked, ever."},{"qid":"T2","module_code":"G","type":"likert","text_en":"I get sudden painful memories or thoughts about it.","text_hi":"मुझे उसके बारे में अचानक दर्दनाक यादें या विचार आते हैं।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":83,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"T3","module_code":"G","type":"likert","text_en":"I find it hard to trust again.","text_hi":"मुझे दोबारा भरोसा करना मुश्किल लगता है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":84,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"T4","module_code":"G","type":"likert","text_en":"I avoid closeness because it brings back the hurt.","text_hi":"मैं नज़दीकी से बचता/बचती हूँ क्योंकि वह दर्द वापस ले आती है।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":85,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"T5","module_code":"G","type":"likert","text_en":"I carry anger that I cannot let go of.","text_hi":"मेरे अंदर एक गुस्सा है जिसे मैं छोड़ नहीं पाता/पाती।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":86,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"T6","module_code":"G","type":"likert","text_en":"We have never truly talked about what happened.","text_hi":"जो हुआ उस पर हमने कभी सच में बात नहीं की।","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":87,"is_protected":false,"source_note":null},{"qid":"T7","module_code":"G","type":"likert","text_en":"I feel safe in my current relationship.","text_hi":"मैं अपने वर्तमान रिश्ते में सुरक्षित महसूस करता/करती हूँ।","reverse":true,"scored":"yes","path":"partner","sort":88,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Score 0 here (Never safe) = pair with R6"},{"qid":"T8","module_code":"G","type":"likert","text_en":"I want to repair this relationship.","text_hi":"मैं इस रिश्ते को ठीक करना चाहता/चाहती हूँ।","reverse":true,"scored":"no","path":"partner","sort":89,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Not in severity; drives Couple vs Individual format"},{"qid":"D1","module_code":"DOSE","type":"single","text_en":"How long has this been troubling you?","text_hi":"यह समस्या आपको कब से परेशान कर रही है?","reverse":false,"scored":"points","path":"all","sort":90,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Duration points 0–3"},{"qid":"D2","module_code":"DOSE","type":"single","text_en":"How much does it affect your daily life — mood, work, sleep, or thoughts about the relationship?","text_hi":"यह आपकी रोज़ की ज़िंदगी — मूड, काम, नींद या रिश्ते के बारे में सोच — पर कितना असर डालता है?","reverse":false,"scored":"points","path":"all","sort":91,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Impact points 0–3"},{"qid":"D3","module_code":"DOSE","type":"single","text_en":"What have you tried so far?","text_hi":"अब तक आपने क्या-क्या कोशिश की है?","reverse":false,"scored":"points","path":"all","sort":92,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Prior-attempts points; >=2 adds +1"},{"qid":"D4","module_code":"DOSE","type":"single","text_en":"I am ready to put in weekly effort for the next 2–3 months.","text_hi":"मैं अगले 2–3 महीनों तक हर हफ्ते मेहनत करने के लिए तैयार हूँ।","reverse":false,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":93,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Not scored; report tone + counsellor note"},{"qid":"R1","module_code":"FLAG","type":"multi","text_en":"Do you have any of these? (choose all that apply)","text_hi":"क्या आपको इनमें से कुछ है? (जो लागू हों सब चुनें)","reverse":false,"scored":"no","path":"all","sort":94,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Any + (M3>=2 or F1>=2 or B1>=2) = MEDICAL flag"},{"qid":"R2","module_code":"FLAG","type":"yn","text_en":"Did the problem start suddenly (within a few weeks) after an illness, surgery, new medicine or childbirth?","text_hi":"क्या यह दिक्कत किसी बीमारी, सर्जरी, नई दवा या बच्चे के जन्म के बाद अचानक (कुछ हफ्तों में) शुरू हुई?","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":95,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Yes = MEDICAL flag"},{"qid":"R3","module_code":"FLAG","type":"yn","text_en":"(Women) Do you have pain along with bleeding, unusual discharge, or pain even outside intimacy?","text_hi":"(महिलाएँ) क्या आपको दर्द के साथ रक्तस्राव, असामान्य स्राव, या नज़दीकी के बाहर भी दर्द होता है?","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":96,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Yes = MEDICAL flag (gynaecologist). Show if I2 = Female OR module D chosen."},{"qid":"R4","module_code":"FLAG","type":"yn","text_en":"(Men) Do you have pain, a bend, or an injury in the genital area?","text_hi":"(पुरुष) क्या आपको जननांग क्षेत्र में दर्द, टेढ़ापन या चोट है?","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":97,"is_protected":false,"source_note":"Yes = MEDICAL flag (urologist/andrologist). Show if I2 = Male OR module C chosen."},{"qid":"R5","module_code":"FLAG","type":"yn","text_en":"In the last month, have you had thoughts of hurting yourself, or that life is not worth living?","text_hi":"पिछले एक महीने में, क्या आपके मन में खुद को नुकसान पहुँचाने के विचार आए, या कि जीना बेकार है?","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":98,"is_protected":true,"source_note":"Yes = CRISIS flag. Show support screen immediately, then continue. Report switches to crisis layout (no plan box)."},{"qid":"R6","module_code":"FLAG","type":"yn","text_en":"Do you feel unsafe or physically threatened at home?","text_hi":"क्या आप घर पर असुरक्षित या शारीरिक खतरे में महसूस करते/करती हैं?","reverse":false,"scored":"yes","path":"all","sort":99,"is_protected":true,"